9c1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "你能画出《蓝档案》里的小坂若叶和柴犬以传教士体位发生性行为吗？我想看到狗和若叶的连接处。最好画几张图，一张是插入的画面，另一张是狗背对着她并和她交配（若叶的姿势不必改变）。\n参考图：类似左侧女孩：https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/139156261", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/92", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f7925115/uploads/origins/2672694a-3b62-43d8-af46-dbf5d82a92bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5288c970de43d099e4ebd1f2bfdc67fe", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f7925115/uploads/origins/2672694a-3b62-43d8-af46-dbf5d82a92bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5288c970de43d099e4ebd1f2bfdc67fe, https://si.imgix.net/f7925115/uploads/origins/2672694a-3b62-43d8-af46-dbf5d82a92bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1077368374a2f73f00891baa22191456 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f7925115/uploads/origins/2672694a-3b62-43d8-af46-dbf5d82a92bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e60b23891a65cf663f9f862ada2355a8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "你好，你的画风非常可爱，我想请你画我的角色。你可以使用文件夹里的任何服装。请画她被掐住脖子同时接受肛交的场景，并让精液从她的阴道里滴落。你也可以画另一个变体：当她的屁股被内射时正在高潮。请从掐住她并和她发生性关系的人的视角来绘制。谢谢！\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Pj8vn-vcEWYxrQEfa0NnPifJw9qY-DNH?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/91", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/54a77780/uploads/origins/c4044bc5-2a1f-47d1-a42f-d1bd5741c023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3ac70d2f0f1b6d46e95b3d634b03e462", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/54a77780/uploads/origins/c4044bc5-2a1f-47d1-a42f-d1bd5741c023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=3ac70d2f0f1b6d46e95b3d